"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-width: 1.06667px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 340.992px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">                                          Shopping Malls</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-width: 1.06667px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 331.968px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">                                                     High</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-71jqu57c1uk4\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-width: 1.06667px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 340.992px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">                                          Public Transport</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-width: 1.06667px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 331.968px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">                                                     High</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-1xc198oemzek\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-width: 1.06667px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 340.992px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">                                                  Parks</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-width: 1.06667px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 331.968px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">                                                   Medium</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-q67vedjbiaa0\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-width: 1.06667px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 340.992px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">                                            Restaurants</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-width: 1.06667px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 331.968px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">                                                     Medium</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><div><b><br>Neighborhood Safety</b></div><div>Safety is important to most renter clients; properties in safety neighborhoods with the lowest crime record tend to go for a lot of money in terms of their rental prices.</div>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p></p><h2><b>2.Interest rates</b></h2><div>As interest rates go up, more people may want to rent good-quality&nbsp; rental homes, which could lead to higher rental prices and more investors, including first-time homebuyers, entering the market.</div><p></p><h2><b>3.Infrastructure</b></h2><p>Baseline tenant expectations, specifically for what is typically included with rent or market tenant preference, will be designated to each rental marker. Typically, large infrastructure projects, such as new transportation services or hospitals, drive the growth of property prices, thus also impacting the rental yields in that area.<br></p><h2><b>4. Property Characteristics</b></h2><p>The specific features of a property greatly influence its rental price.</p><p><b><br>Type of Property</b></p><p>Different types of properties come with varying price tags. For example, standalone houses generally cost more than apartments or studio flats due to their additional space and privacy.</p><p><b><br>Size and Layout</b></p><p>The overall size of the property, including the number of bedrooms and bathrooms, plays a significant role in determining rent. More square footage typically leads to higher rental costs.</p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
